A patch on upstream Mermaid at the pin, for the reference ferrigura is checked against
(docs-port/ORACLE-PLAN.md). Applied in the order of the file names by tools/reference/setup.sh.

fix(detectors): end sankey, packet, xychart and block at the keyword

The detectors took any word that starts with the keyword (sankeyfoo, packet0-7, packet-0-7). They now end at a word boundary, after the keyword or its -beta form, as the fork's detectors and ferrigura do.

diff --git a/packages/mermaid/src/diagrams/block/blockDetector.ts b/packages/mermaid/src/diagrams/block/blockDetector.ts
index 6122221e8..1246443b5 100644
--- a/packages/mermaid/src/diagrams/block/blockDetector.ts
+++ b/packages/mermaid/src/diagrams/block/blockDetector.ts
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ import type { DiagramDetector, ExternalDiagramDefinition } from '../../diagram-a
 const id = 'block';
 
 const detector: DiagramDetector = (txt) => {
-  return /^\s*block(-beta)?/.test(txt);
+  return /^\s*block(-beta)?(?![\w-])/.test(txt);
 };
 
 const loader = async () => {
